  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MKD_Regional Programme on Local Democracy in the Western Balkans 3 (ReLOaD3)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the Action is, therefore, to strengthen participatory democracies and the EU integration process in the Western Balkans, contributing to accelerated sustainable development of the region. It aims to empower civil society to actively engage in decision-making and citizen oversight, while stimulating governments to create a supportive policy, legal and financial environment for civil society.The specific objective of the Action: Strengthened coordination between government</narrative>
  </description>
